<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 8,360 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 125.80 pence a kilo against 123.78 last week and 108.96 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 223,662 pkgs sold so far this year is 112.74 pence against 100.89 pence for the 324,605 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
